+ * Modes 0 SCPL + 3 ASPX_ACPL_2 (observed); 1/2/4 = honest gap.
+ * Grouping 0 only (1/2/3 = honest gap: three/four/five-wide blocks
+ * unlanded). STOPs after the Lb/Rb pair (mode 0) or ASPX legs
